OL,3,AFour reported dead and suspect killed
OL,4,Ain shooting at Oregon elementary school
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have reportedly been killed
OL,7,Fin a shooting at an elementary school
OL,8,Fin the US state of Oregon, local police
OL,9,Fsay
OL,11,FThree of the victims were children, the
OL,12,FBBC's US partner CBS News reports, and
OL,13,Fofficials say the shooter is dead
OL,15,FPolice in Bend, Oregon responded to
OL,16,FSilver Rail Elementary School Thursday
OL,17,Fafternoon on reports that an unknown
OL,18,Fsuspect had fired at a car before
OL,19,Fentering the school
OL,21,FImages show bullet holes in a red truck
OL,22,Foutside of the campus
