OL,3,AFour reported dead and suspect killed
OL,4,Ain shooting at Oregon elementary school
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe suspect was a teenager, CBS
OL,7,Freports, and was reportedly shot dead
OL,8,Fby a bystander
OL,10,FOfficials have not provided any details
OL,11,Fon the identities of the shooter or the
OL,12,Fvictims
OL,14,F"We are stunned and heartbroken by this
OL,15,Fsenseless tragedy," school
OL,16,Fsuperintendent Steven Cook said
